<title>USA: Mazda March US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Mazda March US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mazda Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Mar 1-31, 1997     Mar 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     7,205	     9,676	    -25.5</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   3,024	     4,209	    -28.2</p>
<p> Import Car		10,096	    12,432	    -18.8</p>
<p> Import Truck		 932	     1,362	    -31.6</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Mar 31, 1997 Jan 1-Mar 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    17,553	    22,430	    -20.7</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   8,049	     9,975	    -18.2</p>
<p> Import Car		21,206	    26,292	    -18.3</p>
<p> Import Truck	     3,167	     3,512	     -8.6</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26, 76 for year to date vs 77 in year ago.</p>
</text>
